Subject: [PATCH] msctf: categories, compositions, memory-store contexts,
 properties, profiles (3204)

Category manager item enumeration, GUID descriptions and DWORDs; thread manager
function providers; unsupported sinks answer CONNECT_E_CANNOTCONNECT; contexts
without a text store get an in-memory ITextStoreACP; compositions
(ITfContextComposition, ITfComposition, ITfCompositionView); EnumProperties,
GetAppProperty, TrackProperties, CreateRangeBackup, ITextStoreACPServices
Serialize/Unserialize/ForceLoadProperty; input processor profile removal,
descriptions, language list, ChangeCurrentLanguage, SubstituteKeyboardLayout
and the ITfInputProcessorProfileMgr methods; SetInputScope(s) keeps a window's
scope; display attribute manager OnUpdateInfo.

